 and  he's literally just been  a bystander and is now only choosing to  step in because he felt  that shiguraki was going to lose we  always knew that the will  of author one was inside shigaraki but  we didn't actually think it was really  awful one himself just watching the  whole fight take place  but this right here is basically a  confirmation it does make me wonder  though  what exactly is happening to afo's body  that's in tartarus right now like is  that body still  active are there two afos right now or  is that body like just  not it's just unconscious right now and  he's in shigaraki's body  it's quite kind of confusing how this  works but i guess we'll find out  following this deku goes berserk yet  again and i gotta say i'm consistently  impressed by  harakoshi's range like the range of  angry deku faces it's so varied like i  love it  from midoriya's perspective shigaraki  has potentially killed  gran torino bakugo and izawa blood loss  is a real thing i mean izawa's lost his  leg  bakugou has been stabbed through the  stomach and shoulder and obviously gran  torino got impaled  so in real life there's a high chance of  death for all three of them  but because this is shown in manga i  reckon only  maximum one of them is going to die and  it's going to be gran torino  at present though deku doesn't actually  know he's in a manga  and so you know from his point of view  they could all die and we get this  beautiful spread of him just going crazy  biting in to the force quirk activation  tentacles and and destroying it  his right hand snaps it like it's  nothing and his left side looks like  he's punching the force quirk activation  head on i mean ridiculous stuff what was  especially cool about this moment  was we get a flashback to the words of  lariat who was the fifth user of one for  all  way back in the joint training arc  lariat said to deku  that if he uses the power out of anger  it will start  working for him a lot better he was  referring to 